bad.  I made the directory which holds the source code

/user/games/lib/nethackdir/NH3.1/src

while the "playground" directory was

/user/games/lib/nethackdir

OK so far, right?  WRONG!  When you "make install", one of the things it
does is (cd /user/games/lib/nethackdir ; rm -r *).

Bye bye, source code.... :(

